      <p class="words-eps-en-eyebrow">iOS · Android · EPS-TOPIK</p>
      <h2 id="words-eps-en-title">Try the first two decks free</h2>
      <p>There are seven <span class="words-eps-en-code">EPS-TOPIK</span> (Employment Permit Korean) vocabulary decks. <strong><span class="words-eps-en-code">EPS-1</span> and <span class="words-eps-en-code">EPS-2</span> are free.</strong> <span class="words-eps-en-code">EPS-3–7</span> need the optional bundle or Premium access.</p>
      <p>The standard free allowance is 20 new words and 10 quizzes a day. Reviews of learned words are unlimited. Optional rewarded ads can extend the daily allowance.</p>
      <p>The app has ads and optional in-app purchases. Premium offers a monthly auto-renewing subscription or a one-time lifetime purchase. Use App Store for iOS or Google Play for Android.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

